      "CRT entry 0x402674 calls dispatcher 0x401cb0. Configuration dword 0x404120 is 3; that branch calls 0x401900, then COMSPEC self-deletion helper 0x401390.",
      "0x401900 constructs an Active Setup Installed Components key, sets StubPath at 0x401a4b, reads its own image, modifies a copy, writes it and starts the copied executable at 0x401b7e.",
      "Alternate path 0x401260 deletes/replaces LanmanServer Parameters ServiceDLL. 0x401150 creates a host process, allocates remote memory, writes the DLL path and passes resolved LoadLibraryA to CreateRemoteThread.",
      "The resource extraction path targets DLL resource 101, but the entire resource section is null-filled. No working embedded DLL, ransomware encryption, or successful service injection is inferred.",
      "The .htext section redirects control through long neutral-instruction runs. The PE padding metric also counts inter-section slack; it is not proof of a trailing overlay."
    ],
    "superh": [
      "SH entry 0x4001a0 selects main 0x40a920. Disassembly traces the native socket-based propagation state machine and procfs inspection.",
      "At 0x40dda2 the state machine selects chmod +x / local execution text. It sends that buffer through wrapper 0x411a60, followed by CRLF.",
      "0x411a60 passes arguments to socketcall wrapper 0x412c1c; syscall 102 is entered by trapa 0x12 at 0x412c28.",
      "The same state machine builds HTTP wget, TFTP, ftpget and curl script-transfer commands from the literal pool at 0x40e340..0x40e354, then sends them on the target session.",
      "Procfs process inspection and the GET/dlr. payload-search comparison are cross-referenced from native code. Family-marker strings alone were not used as a conviction."
    ],
