      "CollectorsToListCheckSample calls Collections.reverse; AccessibilityChangeOnRecordsCheckSample declares an ordinary selfModify helper; ReleaseSensors fixtures include real and mocked acquire methods. Their names do not establish obfuscation or a payload loader.",
      "No hostile entrypoint, stealing, surveillance, destruction, deceptive execution or backdoor path was established."
